[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2549800827","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100515#issuecomment-2549800827","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100515","id":2549800827,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6X-t97","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-17T22:40:34Z","updated_at":"2024-12-17T22:40:34Z","body":"I've put up a pull request to fix this, in #100533.\n\nUntil then you can work around this by simply using `state.get_contact_count()` instead of just `get_contact_count()`. You will however end up having contacts reported during the first sleep frame (which is largely what #100533 fixes) so you might want to check for `state.sleeping` if that matters at all to you.\n\n> **Jolt was just integrated to Godot, so I believe this should be in Godot issues. If not let me know!**\n\nIt might be more appropriate to report issues with the extension to the [Godot Jolt](https://github.com/godot-jolt/godot-jolt) repository instead. That way we don't end up burdening the maintainers here with stuff that might perhaps only relate to the extension. I'll apply whatever fix is needed to Godot either way, and backport it to the extension.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2549800827/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569030149","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100515#issuecomment-2569030149","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100515","id":2569030149,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZIEoF","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T10:45:57Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T10:45:57Z","body":"#100533 has now been reverted in favor of #100983, which should make the Jolt Physics module behave as Godot Physics does in terms of contact reporting for sleeping bodies.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569030149/reactions","total_count":